<section class="how-section shell" id="how-it-works"><div class="how-card"><div class="how-copy"><span class="section-kicker">THREE STEPS</span><h2>Test in under a minute</h2><p>Everything happens inside your browser. Connect the controller in your operating system first; this site does not pair Bluetooth or install drivers.</p><a class="primary-button" href="#tester">Start testing <span>→</span></a></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span>01</span><div><h3>Connect first</h3><p>Pair Bluetooth or plug in USB through Windows, macOS or Linux.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>02</span><div><h3>Press any button</h3><p>Browsers usually wake the Gamepad API after your first input.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>03</span><div><h3>Inspect the signal</h3><p>Move sticks, press buttons and test supported rumble output.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
